@startuml
title Biểu đồ lớp - Guest Mode và Cổng chuyển đổi

class User {
  +id: UUID
  +email: String
  +passwordHash: String
  +role: Role
}

class PatientProfile {
  +id: UUID
  +nickname: String
  +avatarIcon: String
  +anonymousModeEnabled: Boolean
  +realFullName: String
  +phoneNumber: String
  +lsasDemoCompleted: Boolean
  +safetyGateCompleted: Boolean
  +medicalProfileCompleted: Boolean
}

class GuestSessionDto {
  +isGuest: Boolean
  +accountLinked: Boolean
  +canViewLsasResult: Boolean
}

class AnonymousRegisterRequest {
  +nickname: String
  +avatarIcon: String
  +deviceId: String
}

class LinkGuestAccountRequest {
  +email: String
  +password: String
  +realFullName: String
  +phoneNumber: String
}

class AuthController {
  +registerAnonymous(request)
  +linkGuestAccount(request)
}

class AuthService {
  +registerAnonymous(request)
  +linkGuestAccount(request)
}

enum Role {
  GUEST
  PATIENT
}

User "1" -- "0..1" PatientProfile
AuthController ..> AuthService
AuthController ..> AnonymousRegisterRequest
AuthController ..> LinkGuestAccountRequest
AuthService ..> User
AuthService ..> PatientProfile
AuthService ..> GuestSessionDto

note right of PatientProfile
anonymousModeEnabled chỉ áp dụng cho Patient,
không dùng để biểu diễn Guest.
end note

@enduml